e, and they simply raced to the finish, with point-for-place scoring used to determine the winning teams."] "\n\n" [:p {} "Four heats were held in the first round, with France, Italy, the United States, and the mixed British/New Zealand team advancing to the semi-finals. In the semis, the United States defeated Italy, and France defeated the mixed team to set up the final."] "\n\n" [:p {} "The final was very close, with the United States winning over France, with the riders finishing in the following order: 1) " [:a {:href "/athletes/890867"} "Edmond Jacquelin"] ", 2) " [:a {:href "/athletes/890355"} "Tom Cooper"] ", 3) " [:a {:href "/athletes/891095"} "Floyd McFarland"] ", 4) " [:a {:href "/athletes/890185"} "Paul Bourillon"] ", 5) " [:a {:href "/athletes/890060"} "George Banker"] ", and 6) " [:a {:href "/athletes/891080"} "Jean-Baptiste Louvet"] ". The US finishes of 2-3-5 gave them 10 points to France’s 11, for finishes of 1-4-6. Italy easily defeated the mixed British/New Zealand team for third place, winning 8-13."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitors"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "R1"] [:th {} "SF"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} "United States"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/USA.png"}] "USA"]] [:td {} "8 points (1 h3)"] [:td {} "8 points (1 h1)"] [:td {} "10 points (1 h1)"] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {}] [:td {:colspan "11"} [:a {:href "/athletes/890355"} "Tom Cooper"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/891095"} "Floyd McFarland"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/890060"} "George Banker"]]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} "France"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/FRA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-ce